<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH/SCOTTISH F.A. CUP REPLAY DATES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH/SCOTTISH F.A. CUP REPLAY DATES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Replay dates for English and</p>
<p>Scottish F.A. Cup matches drawn on Saturday:</p>
<p>Tuesday, January 28:</p>
<p>Scottish F.A. Cup third round replays - Aberdeen v</p>
<p>Hibernian, Greenock Morton v Arbroath.</p>
<p>Tuesday, February 4:</p>
<p>English F.A. Cup third round replay - Woking v Coventry.</p>
<p>English F.A. Cup fourth round replay  Wimbledon v Manchester</p>
<p>United.</p>
<p>Scottish F.A. Cup third round replay - Berwick v Falkirk.</p>
</text>
